cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Opposing directions in blood metal mixtures and mortality in US adults"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a pooled NHANES study (1999-2018, 10 cycles) examining
  associations of blood lead, cadmium and mercury (plus selenium and manganese)
  with all-cause and cardiovascular mortality, including survey-weighted
  single-metal Cox models, quantile g-computation with directional decomposition,
  restricted cubic splines, cause-specific analyses, delayed-entry and
  selection-bias characterisation, and multiple sensitivity analyses.
authors:
  - family-names: Wen
    given-names: Yuxiang
version: 1.0.6
date-released: "2026-09-27"
